<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mixed in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 589.38, up 1.39.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 287 to 263.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.03.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 26,664,525, compared with 25,578,230 Friday.</p>
<p>		 (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
